{"id":"ideal_no","lemma":"идеально","pos":"adv","rank":1000,"glosses":["ideally (in various senses)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/97/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Кажется, всё идеально.","en":"Everything seems ideal.","words":[{"g":"apparently, it seems"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Это было абсолютно идеально.","en":"It was absolutely perfect.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"absolutely"},null]},{"text":"Всё должно быть идеально.","en":"Everything must be perfect.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"it must be, probably"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"То платье идеально тебе идёт.","en":"That dress is perfect for you.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"dress, gown, frock"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"to go","l":"идти"}]},{"text":"Я хочу, чтобы всё было идеально.","en":"I want it to be perfect.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]}]}